/Title (Aptech Computer Training is a Learning Solutions Company playing a key role in helping Individuals, Organizations and Universities adapt to the changing requirements of a knowledge-driven world. Aptech commenced its IT and NON IT Education & Training business from 1994 in UAE. We are a Ministry Approved Training Center \(KHDA\). Newly emerging trends and technologies like Artificial Intelligence \(AI\), Cloud Computing, Mobile Applications, Multimedia Courses, Social Media and Data Analytics are bringing about increasing job opportunities in the IT & ICT industry. Aptech Computer Training, through its courses and curriculum, ensures that you are at par with global standards.)
